  "★ Code Question": "<img src=\"..\/..\/source\/media\/draw-lisp-rocket-outline.png\"\r\nalt=\"The image will need to be added to Anki first\" \/>",


  "☆ Code Answer": "<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb1\"><pre\nclass=\"sourceCode elm\"><code class=\"sourceCode elm\"><span id=\"cb1-1\"><a href=\"#cb1-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>(<span class=\"fu\">require</span> <span class=\"dv\">2</span><span class=\"fu\">htdp</span><span class=\"op\">/</span><span class=\"fu\">image</span>)</span>\n<span id=\"cb1-2\"><a href=\"#cb1-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-3\"><a href=\"#cb1-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>; <span class=\"dt\">Here</span>&#39;<span class=\"fu\">s</span> <span class=\"fu\">the</span> <span class=\"fu\">constants</span></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-4\"><a href=\"#cb1-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-5\"><a href=\"#cb1-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>(<span class=\"fu\">define</span> <span class=\"dt\">WIDTH</span> <span class=\"dv\">180</span>)</span>\n<span id=\"cb1-6\"><a href=\"#cb1-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>(<span class=\"fu\">define</span> <span class=\"dt\">HEIGHT</span> <span class=\"dv\">180</span>)</span>\n<span id=\"cb1-7\"><a href=\"#cb1-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>(<span class=\"fu\">define</span> <span class=\"dt\">MIDDLE</span> (<span class=\"op\">/</span> <span class=\"dt\">WIDTH</span> <span class=\"dv\">2</span>))</span>\n<span id=\"cb1-8\"><a href=\"#cb1-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-9\"><a href=\"#cb1-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>(<span class=\"fu\">define</span> <span class=\"dt\">BACKGROUND</span></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-10\"><a href=\"#cb1-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>  (<span class=\"fu\">rectangle</span> <span class=\"dt\">WIDTH</span> <span class=\"dt\">HEIGHT</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;solid&quot;</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;black&quot;</span>))</span>\n<span id=\"cb1-11\"><a href=\"#cb1-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-12\"><a href=\"#cb1-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>(<span class=\"fu\">define</span> <span class=\"dt\">ROCKET</span></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-13\"><a href=\"#cb1-13\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>  (<span class=\"fu\">bitmap</span><span class=\"op\">/</span><span class=\"fu\">file</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;rocket.png&quot;</span>))</span>\n<span id=\"cb1-14\"><a href=\"#cb1-14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-15\"><a href=\"#cb1-15\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>(<span class=\"fu\">define</span> <span class=\"dt\">MOON</span></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-16\"><a href=\"#cb1-16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>  (<span class=\"fu\">circle</span> <span class=\"dv\">40</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;solid&quot;</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;white&quot;</span>))</span>\n<span id=\"cb1-17\"><a href=\"#cb1-17\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-18\"><a href=\"#cb1-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>; <span class=\"dt\">Let</span>&#39;<span class=\"fu\">s</span> <span class=\"fu\">make</span> <span class=\"fu\">our</span> <span class=\"fu\">image</span><span class=\"op\">!</span></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-19\"><a href=\"#cb1-19\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-20\"><a href=\"#cb1-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>(<span class=\"fu\">place</span><span class=\"op\">-</span><span class=\"fu\">image</span></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-21\"><a href=\"#cb1-21\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>  <span class=\"dt\">ROCKET</span> <span class=\"dt\">MIDDLE</span> <span class=\"dt\">MIDDLE</span></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-22\"><a href=\"#cb1-22\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    (<span class=\"fu\">place</span><span class=\"op\">-</span><span class=\"fu\">image</span></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-23\"><a href=\"#cb1-23\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>      <span class=\"dt\">MOON</span> <span class=\"dv\">10</span> <span class=\"dv\">10</span></span>\n<span id=\"cb1-24\"><a href=\"#cb1-24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"dt\">BACKGROUND</span>))</span></code></pre></div>",


  "★ Answer": "<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Lisp feels a bit back-to-front and inside-out</strong> when\nyou first start!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Our <code>Rocket</code> is the last item to be processed, and our\n<code>BACKGROUND</code> variable the first. <em>How To Design\nPrograms</em> is a great place to learn programming fundamentals.</p>",


  "☆ Answer Notes": "<p>Racket processes functions from the <em>inside → out</em>.\nLisp languages calculate the <em>inner-most</em> function (data or variable)\nFIRST. It then works inside-out to render our <code>ROCKET</code>.\nThat’s very maths-like. Try the first two chapters of <a\nhref=\"https://htdp.org\">HTDP</a>, then try <a\nhref=\"https://elm-lang.org\">Elm Lang</a>!</p>",


